              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "axios: axios: Denial of Service via maxBodyLength bypass with ReadableStream"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "axios versions 1.7.0 before 1.18.0 fail to enforce maxBodyLength for WHATWG ReadableStream request bodies in the fetch adapter when Content-Length cannot be determined. Attackers can supply unknown-length stream data to bypass upload size limits and cause uncontrolled network egress or resource exhaustion."
